design_notes = "Matrix contract: Channel / Spatial / Environmental. The first integrated pass owns the quake as a short persistent field after cast and exposes receive_earthquake_pulse / receive_seismic_pulse hooks so terrain, props, mechanisms, enemies, and future destruction systems can author their own response without coupling to this spell. A later channel-input pass can drive this same field continuously."
